          "name": "Road test day",
          "description": "What to bring and check before the test",
          "items": "[\"Learner's permit and photo ID\", \"Signed practice log (day and night hours)\", \"Car registration and insurance card\", \"Car passes the safety check: lights, signals, horn, mirrors\", \"Arrive 20 minutes early\", \"Parent or guardian present if under 18\"]"
        }
      ],
